# ── KiCad ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local History and tool backups: regenerable, and byte-identical to the
# working files. See docs/14_Design_Consistency_Audit.md.
.history/
.mcp-backups/
*-backups/
fp-info-cache
_autosave-*

# Per-user editor state, not design data
*.kicad_prl

# Editor lock files
~*.lck
*.lck

# ── LTspice ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .asc / .net / .lib are sources and ARE tracked.
# .raw / .log are simulation results and are ALSO tracked deliberately:
# they are the evidence behind every simulated figure in docs/.
# Nothing to ignore here.

# ── Tooling ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.ltspice-mcp/
.obsidian/

# ── OS / editor ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
